{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14684","headline":"奉同汴州李相公勉送郭布殿中出巡 · 戴叔伦","name":"奉同汴州李相公勉送郭布殿中出巡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩车出东阁，都邑遶南河。\n马首先春至，人心比岁和。\n省风传隐恤，持法去烦苛。\n却想埋轮者，论功此日多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}